    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\n\nSherry FitzGerald Conor McManus are delighted to present to the market Ard Josaif, Mullanamoy, Clones, Co. Monaghan.\n\nA quality detached bungalow, offering generous family accommodation, in a convenient and established residential setting.\n\nThe accommodation comprises the entrance hallway, sitting room, and an open-plan sitting/dining room and the kitchen. There are four well-proportioned bedrooms, a bathroom and guest toilet. To the rear are a variety of storage sheds.\n\nThis well-appointed home combines comfortable family living with excellent outdoor amenities, all within easy reach of the shops, schools and services of Clones Town Centre.\n\nViewing by appointment only with the agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nA glazed porch provides shelter to the main entrance. The welcoming entrance hall gives access to the accommodation.\n\nLiving Room: - \nA feature of note in the room is the corner window which draws an abundance of natural light.\n\nSitting/ Dining Room: - \nA well-appointed, everyday living and dining room with patio door access to the rear garden\n\nKitchen: - \nFitted kitchen, tiled splashback, large window with pleasant garden outlook.\n\nGuest WC: - \nConveniently located in the back hall.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nFront facing double bedroom, bay window, carpet floor.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nFront facing double bedroom, carpet floor.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nFront facing double bedroom, carpet floor.\n\nBedroom 4: - \nRear facing bedroom, carpet floor.\n\nBathroom: - \nA generously proportioned family bathroom fitted with a bath, separate shower, wash hand basin and WC.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Total Floor Area: 140 sq mts (1507 sq ft approximately)</li><li>Ideally located along the pretigious Newtownbutler Road</li><li>Convenient single-storey layout</li><li>Spacious and versatile family accommodation</li><li>Generous rear garden with patio area</li><li>Boiler room and useful storage space</li><li>Within easy reach of Clones town centre and its range of amenities</li><li>Ideal family home with excellent potential for modernisation to suit individual tastes</li><li>Oil-fired central heating</li><li>Diesel generator for power outages</li><li>Intruder alarm</li><li>uPVC double glazed windows</li><li>Hi-speed broadband available</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: G\nBER No: 119606291\n"
      },
      {
